{"agent":"impl-decide-docs","data":{"body":"Single writer per item; no private queues. Research docs/ddflow/research/swarm-orchestration.md; proposal docs/ddflow/decisions/swarm-orchestration.md. Start only after SW-decide has recorded the D-SW-* answers (SW-decide is not in needs on purpose, L-needs-on-decide-tasks).\n\nAMENDED by D-swarm-answers (SW-Q2, operator 2026-10-24): the scheduler MAY also LAUNCH lanes itself from operator-approved templates, not only answer pulls; launching stays bound by D-agent-parity consent and the approved-template registry, with an audit event per launch. SW-decide recorded the answers."},"id":"e4c74e8050a3ec02ec043eb5f","kind":"task.updated","lamport":118492,"schema":1,"subject":"SW-pull","ts":"2026-10-31T11:30:46.968589Z"}
